    {
      "name": "em_compare",
      "title": "Compare products side by side",
      "description": "Compare 2-5 Emalls products: prices, rating and only the specs whose values differ.\n\nUse it to choose between models. `specs` maps each differing spec to a value per product id (missing = no\nvalue); `same` counts shared specs. Then em_offers for the winner.",
